the trees, right?

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:40.820
You could do that with this.

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:44.330
And that's a much more
serious application of this.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:47.422
But it's the same principle,
pizza on the forests.

00:02:47.422 --> 00:02:48.380
RETO MEIER: Absolutely.

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:51.102
No, and it's a fun way
to approach Machine

00:02:51.102 --> 00:02:52.310
Learning, that sort of stuff.

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:53.300
Fantastic.

